READ: frac_zero is the sparsity gp2Scale would get FOR FREE -- no radius, no
hyperparameter, PSD by construction. Compare with our PLS route, where the
10-dim continuous embedding admits NO exact zeros and the radius has to
manufacture them. purity >> chance means the surviving pairs are chemically
alike, i.e. the sparsity is BLOCK sparsity reflecting chemistry -- the
position paper's sec-3 success mode.
